{
  "_comment": "F659: the one MC address normaliser (app/src/mcurl.js normaliseMcUrl). `in` is what a person typed, scanned, or what discovery or a stored value gave; `url` is the node websocket to dial and `join` the secret/pub split out of the query (never dialled); `refused` is true when no address can be made. Rule: the console port 8765 maps to the node port 8766, any path becomes /ws, and a wss tunnel host keeps its host and port. The M5Stick validator (hardware/m5sticks3/station_persistence.h saved_mc_url_refusal) only CHECKS a ws://host:port/path url and normalises nothing, so these cases are phone-only; MC builds join urls and parses none. Read by app/test/mcurl-normalise.test.mjs. Stick differs on purpose: station_persistence.h saved_mc_url_refusal accepts :8765 and any path, and refuses a query (the Stick is not changed).",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "the canonical node url is unchanged",
      "in": "ws://192.0.2.55:8766/ws",
      "url": "ws://192.0.2.55:8766/ws",
      "join": {}
    },
    {
      "name": "console port 8765 maps to the node port",
      "in": "ws://192.0.2.55:8765/ws",
      "url": "ws://192.0.2.55:8766/ws",
      "join": {}
    },
    {
      "name": "console port and a bare path",
      "in": "ws://192.0.2.55:8765/",
      "url": "ws://192.0.2.55:8766/ws",
      "join": {}
    },
    {
      "name": "the field bug: ?s= is split into the join, never dialled",
      "in": "ws://192.0.2.55:8766/ws?s=abc123",
      "url": "ws://192.0.2.55:8766/ws",
      "join": {
        "secret": "abc123"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "console port plus a secret",
      "in": "ws://192.0.2.55:8765/ws?s=abc123",
      "url": "ws://192.0.2.55:8766/ws",
      "join": {
        "secret": "abc123"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "secret and backhaul pub",
      "in": "ws://192.0.2.55:8766/ws?s=abc&pub=wss%3A%2F%2Fx.trycloudflare.com%2Fws",
      "url": "ws://192.0.2.55:8766/ws",
      "join": {
        "secret": "abc",
        "pub": "wss://x.trycloudflare.com/ws"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a malformed pub drops only the pub",
      "in": "ws://192.0.2.55:8766/ws?pub=notaurl&s=abc",
      "url": "ws://192.0.2.55:8766/ws",
      "join": {
        "secret": "abc"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "the scheme is case-insensitive",
      "in": "WS://192.0.2.55:8766/ws",
      "url": "ws://192.0.2.55:8766/ws",
      "join": {}
    },
    {
      "name": "surrounding space is trimmed",
      "in": "  ws://192.0.2.55:8766/ws  ",
      "url": "ws://192.0.2.55:8766/ws",
      "join": {}
    },
    {
      "name": "a missing path becomes /ws",
      "in": "ws://192.0.2.55:8766",
      "url": "ws://192.0.2.55:8766/ws",
      "join": {}
    },
    {
      "name": "a path other than /ws becomes /ws",
      "in": "ws://192.0.2.55:8766/node",
      "url": "ws://192.0.2.55:8766/ws",
      "join": {}
    },
    {
      "name": "a trailing slash on /ws is dropped",
      "in": "ws://192.0.2.55:8766/ws/",
      "url": "ws://192.0.2.55:8766/ws",
      "join": {}
    },
    {
      "name": "another explicit port is kept",
      "in": "ws://192.0.2.55:9000/ws",
